// Title: PrintBrm ZIP Creation of Extraction
// Sigma ID: cafeeba3-01da-4ab4-b6c4-a31b1d9730c7
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-05-02 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: command-and-control, stealth, T1105, T1564.004
// Description: Detects the execution of the LOLBIN PrintBrm.exe, which can be used to create or extract ZIP
//   files. PrintBrm.exe should not be run on a normal workstation.
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://lolbas-project.github.io/lolbas/Binaries/PrintBrm/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_lolbin_printbrm.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, microsoft_xdr schema)

DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "\\PrintBrm.exe" and (ProcessCommandLine contains " -f" and ProcessCommandLine contains ".zip")
